		(property "Review Notes" "Permanent NXE2 minimum-load resistor across filtered isolated 5V and ISO_RET; before LD1117 input. Changed 120 ohm to 100 ohm for low-voltage margin. 50mA and 0.250W at 5V. At +1% resistance, draws at least 40mA when rail >=4.04V (before TCR). Do not count this current as available external load. Use 0.5W-rated 1206, not ordinary 0.25W. Check thermal derating at maximum board ambient; verify converter input range and minimum filtered voltage on hardware."
